# Build outputs — prevent host obj/ from overwriting container restore
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# IDE / editor files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Docker
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore

# Secrets (never bake into images)
**/local.settings.json
**/appsettings.Development.json

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
